{"parse":{"title":"WIKI建议留言板（必回）","pageid":7528,"revid":18813,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=WIKI%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=WIKI%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=WIKI%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a>  &gt; <b>WIKI建议留言板（必回）</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"bg-snm\" style=\"color: #a94442; border: 1px solid #5cb85c; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n<ul><li>本页面用于铃友们讨论并留下对BWIKI的建设意见等等(◍•ᴗ•◍)♡</li>\n<li>请使用右上的编辑功能参与讨论。\n<ul><li>请勿删除他人的讨论信息。</li>\n<li>新建话题时请使用：<kbd>==话题名称==</kbd></li>\n<li>可在对应话题旁编辑功能参与讨论。</li>\n<li><kbd>*</kbd>加上留言信息进行留言讨论。</li>\n<li>在留言后复制添加：<kbd>--~~~~</kbd>可以留下你的用户信息和留言时间。</li>\n<li>在他人留言信息下方添加 <kbd>**</kbd>加上留言信息可以回复他人进行讨论。</li></ul></li>\n<li>也可在页面下方评论区留下评论参与讨论～</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:-15px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"笔记.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/40px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/60px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/80px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />预计新增</div>\n\t<div style=\"padding-right:0px;\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n\t<div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 83%; background:#66a3d2\"></div>\n<p>\t<span><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A1%A8%E6%83%85%E6%B1%87%E6%80%BB\" title=\"表情汇总\">表情包 249/300</a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n\t<div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background:rgb(160,208,107)\"></div>\n<p>\t<span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%B7%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"家具图鉴（页面不存在）\">家具 0/100</a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.9F.A5.E8.AF.86.E9.97.AE.E7.AD.94.28.E6.97.A0.E5.88.86.E7.B1.BB.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"知识问答(无分类)\"><img alt=\"铃兰花.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5c/c9v827oic8pr6h30u33hunhp6yj2hge.png/30px-%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%8A%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5c/c9v827oic8pr6h30u33hunhp6yj2hge.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /><font color=\"#b88646\"><b>知识问答(无分类)</b></font></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=WIKI%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%88%E5%BF%85%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：知识问答(无分类)\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>希望铃兰之剑越来越好--<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7:393326856&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"用户:393326856（页面不存在）\">393326856</a>（<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%94